('EN7-Q18',['symbol-of-stunning'],'Stunned is hard control; one-shot discharge, every target save and repeated entry/suppression have distinct identities.','A: exactly one committed discharge, current eligible target snapshot and independent saves with finite stun duration/ending under shared admission. B: refill through a new encounter, suppressed trigger or repeated entry.','Recommend A. Specify whether suppressed arming pauses, consumes or simply fails to trigger while original finite clock continues; no deferred hidden queue. Distinguish established target rider suppression from loss of the source rune. Immune/guard-blocked target gets no invented soft fallback; a legally consumed rune remains spent even when every target saves. Existing Stunned conditions persist independently.'),
